WEBVTT

asr-000001
00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:13.660
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: May I now recognize the Representative from the Minority, Representative Sheen Gonzales.

asr-000002
00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:28.000
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair. Magandang hapon po sa ating lahat, to my colleagues, sa DA family, headed by Sec. Kiko Laurel.

asr-000003
00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:44.460
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Bago po ako magtanong ng ilang mga questions, gusto ko pong magpasalamat sa ating Department of Agriculture Secretary sa mga programa po na binibigay doon sa probinsya po ng Eastern Samar, sa Long District of Eastern Samar.

asr-000004
00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:56.460
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang dami na po yung natulungan doon and nagpapasalamat din po ako sa mga darating pa ng mga tulong na ibibigay po sa probinsya po ng Eastern Samar.

asr-000005
00:12:56.460 --> 00:13:00.740
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Mayroon lang po akong ilang katanungan sa BIFAR.

asr-000006
00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:21.760
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Noong last year, nagkaroon po kami ng pagpupulong at during the budget season also, budget hearing, mayroon pong pinag-usapan at nag-pledge po ang ating BIFAR na magkakaroon po ng rehabilitation,

asr-000007
00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:26.420
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: yung research and training center ng region.

asr-000008
00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:31.640
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: At ito po ay nasa Giwan, Eastern Samar.

asr-000009
00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:41.540
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Alam ko po yung lugar na to kasi dito po ako pinanganak sa lugar na to at nag-mayor din po ako dito sa bayan na to.

asr-000010
00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:47.900
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Simula po ng mabagyo ng Yolanda, hindi pa po ito natutotal rehab.

asr-000011
00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:54.780
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Si Director Aziz Perez, siya po pa po yung director noon, ng time ng Yolanda.

asr-000012
00:13:56.460 --> 00:14:04.680
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Hindi pa po ito natutotal rehab pero nagsabi po yung BIFAR last year na magkakaroon po ng pondo at i-rehab po nila.

asr-000013
00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:18.680
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: So, ang tanong ko lang po Mr. Chair, with the good secretary, even the BIFAR through Director Toto, gusto ko lang po itanong ano po kaya ang status na nito?

asr-000014
00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:25.650
BFAR Director Elizer S. Salilig: Yes, Mr. Chair. May ongoing na po tayo rehab doon.

asr-000015
00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:27.670
BFAR Director Elizer S. Salilig: And there po sa national program.

asr-000016
00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:33.550
BFAR Director Elizer S. Salilig: The Fisheries Department Institute of Research, and there po kay Director Mutia.

asr-000017
00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:43.030
BFAR Director Elizer S. Salilig: Sir, naka-concept na sila worth 5 million but kung anong kulang po, willing po ang BIFAR mag-support sa pinansyal.

asr-000018
00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:53.190
BFAR Director Elizer S. Salilig: Nandito po rin ating Director po, iniparty ay, pwede rin siya magbigay ng kanyang opinion na talagang ginagawa na namin yung Seryom Khan, yung project.

asr-000019
00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:54.950
BFAR Director Elizer S. Salilig: Please, with the permission of the Chair.

asr-000020
00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:56.430
BFAR Director Elizer S. Salilig: Thank you, Sir.

asr-000021
00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:10.560
NFRDI Executive Director Maria Theresa M. Mutia: Hello, Mr. Chair. Ako po si Maris Mutia, ang currently Executive Director of National Fisheries Research and Development Institute.

asr-000022
00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:25.280
NFRDI Executive Director Maria Theresa M. Mutia: Sa kasalukuyan po ay meron po kaming nailaan na about 10.6 million po para po sa rehabilitation ng research facilities po sa Giwan Summer po.

asr-000023
00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:44.060
NFRDI Executive Director Maria Theresa M. Mutia: And meron din po counterpart doon, ang BIFAR, around 2.5 million. So ongoing po yun, i-improve po natin yung ating research facilities, yung ating laboratory, dormitory, abalone, hatchery, at iba pa pong facilities.

asr-000024
00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:48.980
NFRDI Executive Director Maria Theresa M. Mutia: Matatapos po yun by October po this year.

asr-000025
00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:53.180
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yes, thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000026
00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.160
NFRDI Executive Director Maria Theresa M. Mutia: Ito po ay phase one pa lang po.

asr-000027
00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:55.540
NFRDI Executive Director Maria Theresa M. Mutia: Ito.

asr-000028
00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:57.680
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Thank you po.

asr-000029
00:15:57.820 --> 00:16:00.180
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair. Maraming salamat, ma'am.

asr-000030
00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:04.540
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Pwede po ba akong makahingi ng rehabilitation plan nyo?

asr-000031
00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:11.340
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi kailangan po dito yung total rehab. Mahirap po yung pachi-pachi.

asr-000032
00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:19.240
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi it is the research and training center of the whole region. Nandun po ito.

asr-000033
00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:25.240
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Paano tayo makakapag-produce o makakapag-produce?

asr-000034
00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:42.300
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Makakapag-pakita na maganda po ang kahihinat na ng Region 8 in terms of research and development with regards to BIFAR kung hindi po ito maaayos ng tama.

asr-000035
00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:52.160
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Can I ask the BIFAR family to give me the total rehabilitation plan?

asr-000036
00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:52.640
NFRDI Executive Director Maria Theresa M. Mutia: Opo.

asr-000037
00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.740
NFRDI Executive Director Maria Theresa M. Mutia: Mr. Chair, we will submit po.

asr-000038
00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.560
NFRDI Executive Director Maria Theresa M. Mutia: Yung rehabilitation plan.

asr-000039
00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:01.810
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Mr. Chair, thank you.

asr-000040
00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:11.270
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yung pangalawang question ko po, yung mandato po ng ating mahal na Pangulo to the department is food sufficiency.

asr-000041
00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:17.950
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: In other words, sa bawat Pilipino, kailangan secure po yung pagkain.

asr-000042
00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:22.230
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Address naman po ito sa NIA.

asr-000043
00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:26.290
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Alam ko po na may mga rehabilitasyon.

asr-000044
00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.230
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: May mga programang rehabilitasyon.

asr-000045
00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:53.610
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: At sa programang ito, nagbaba kasakali or ako po ay nangihihin ng intervention sa ating administrator na mapasama sa listahan ng pag-rehabilitate po ng Dolores Valley, also called the Sikonton Valley Irrigation Facilities.

asr-000046
00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:58.610
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ito po ay located sa Dolores Eastern City.

asr-000047
00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:05.970
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ang lugar po ito, ito po ay rice granary ng probinsya ng Eastern Samar.

asr-000048
00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:12.410
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: At hindi lang po ito nagbibigay ng pag-asa sa mga taga Eastern Samar.

asr-000049
00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:24.730
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: At hindi lang po ito nakakapagbigay ng ating pagkain sa Eastern Samar, kundi sa buong Region 8, once upon a time, being the rice granary,

asr-000050
00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:27.730
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: ay naging asset po ito ng ating...

asr-000051
00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:30.690
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: regiyon, ng aming regiyon.

asr-000052
00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:39.550
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: So yung sa akin po, if you have any intervention or meron po kayong plano to rehabilitate that area.

asr-000053
00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.510
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000054
00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:43.930
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-000055
00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:50.170
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Actually, totoo yun. Napakaganda po nung area ng ating kagahanagalan na congressman.

asr-000056
00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:55.090
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And meron po tayong proposal doon, meron po tayong plano doon, Mr. Chair.

asr-000057
00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:57.710
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At we hope to implement that also.

asr-000058
00:18:58.890 --> 00:19:08.930
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Next year, ang hindi lamang yun, tinignan namin pati yung mga areas doon, yung mga hindi pa natatapos na mga irrigation projects po doon,

asr-000059
00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:12.870
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: pinapatapos na ng Pangulo, yung sa may katubig.

asr-000060
00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:20.110
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So lahat po nung sa area ng Samar, Mr. Chair, ay tinitignan natin at ginagawa natin.

asr-000061
00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:23.530
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kasi totoo nung nga naman, napakaganda po yung area, Mr. Chair.

asr-000062
00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:28.590
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Salamat po, Admin. At napakaganda pong pakinggan.

asr-000063
00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:35.470
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: At committed naman po tayo na i-rehabilita yung lugar na yun.

asr-000064
00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:38.170
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: At hinding-hindi po kayo magsisisi dyan.

asr-000065
00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:57.990
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Pag yan ay na-rehabilita, makikita nyo po ang kabuhayan ng tao at ang probinsya ng Sinlangan Samar ay mag-i-increase yung hanap buhay at ang tinatawag na GDP growth ng probinsya.

asr-000066
00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.530
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Ay sigurado ako na mag-i-increase po.

asr-000067
00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:10.170
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: My last question, Mr. Chair. Actually, I will not ask question anymore.

asr-000068
00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:13.470
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi yung time ko, tumunog na.

asr-000069
00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:23.410
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Yung sa akin na lang po, Mr. Chair, yung mga programa ng Department of Agriculture, ipagpatuloy na lang po.

asr-000070
00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:28.550
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Kasi sa probinsya ng Eastern Samar, alam naman po natin,

asr-000071
00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:37.650
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: yung fishing industry at saka mga farmland po doon, ay umaasa po ang mga tao natin doon, Mr. Chair, Secretary.

asr-000072
00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:55.070
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, bababaho ako personally sa Eastern Samar sa October with BIFAR and yung ibang members of my team para magbigay ng dagdag na suporta at makita yung actual situation in the ground

asr-000073
00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:58.770
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: para mas masilbihan pa sila sa 2021.

asr-000074
00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:01.250
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000075
00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:08.890
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: Dagang salamat, damang salamat, Secretary and the DA family.

asr-000076
00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:10.110
Rep. Christopher Sheen P. Gonzales: God bless.

