Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Deputy Speaker Biron.

asr-000101-split-2
00:22:47.900 --> 00:22:56.900
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Mr. Chair, sorry. Alright, thank you, Mr. Chair. Secretary, magandang hapon po.

asr-000102
00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:10.680
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: First of all, I would like to thank you for visiting my district and for providing us with one of the biggest warehouse facility in the province of Iloilo.

asr-000103
00:23:10.680 --> 00:23:25.240
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: I was just talking to our regional director with respect to the rice processing facility that your department, your office, has committed since three years ago, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000104
00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:39.820
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: So far, tatlong taon na yung lumipas. Hanggang ngayon, Sec, the project has yet to be implemented.

asr-000105
00:23:39.820 --> 00:23:48.360
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: I recall that in 2023, this was committed under ODA by Yusec Jerome.

asr-000106
00:23:49.160 --> 00:24:05.820
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Pero hanggang ngayon, as I was talking to Regional Director Arpia, late last year, yung buong farmers organization and cooperatives in the municipality of Dumangas,

asr-000107
00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:09.700
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: which happens to be the biggest, the largest produced rice.

asr-000108
00:24:09.820 --> 00:24:21.900
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: The biggest producing municipality in the entire Panay region, Panay Island, he promised to download the farm equipment from Philmec.

asr-000109
00:24:23.080 --> 00:24:32.520
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Lahat po, Sec, ng mga requirements including FS, including audited financial statements, were all complied with.

asr-000110
00:24:32.520 --> 00:24:38.860
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Pero hanggang ngayon, I just want to seek the guidance of the good secretary.

asr-000111
00:24:39.560 --> 00:24:41.080
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Kung kailan talaga?

asr-000112
00:24:41.100 --> 00:24:48.080
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Kung kailan talaga ito, Sec, ma-implement. Kasi may warehouse na tayo, pero wala pa rin tayong rice processing facility.

asr-000113
00:24:48.840 --> 00:24:50.340
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000114
00:24:50.900 --> 00:24:59.880
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, I'm, well, technically, pasensya na kayo at na-delay talaga yung project ninyo.

asr-000115
00:24:59.960 --> 00:25:08.260
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But since bumaba ako doon the last time at I coordinated with Philmec, palagang meron na naka-alat sa inyong RPS.

asr-000116
00:25:08.260 --> 00:25:10.260
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And I would like to ask our...

asr-000117
00:25:11.100 --> 00:25:17.620
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I would like to ask our Philmec director to give you the actual timelines na now para matapos na ho yan, Mr. Chair.

asr-000118
00:25:20.580 --> 00:25:24.340
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Magandang gabi po, Mr. Congressman.

asr-000119
00:25:24.940 --> 00:25:31.800
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: Actually, yung warehouse na itatayo natin doon sa inyo, ang floor area niya ay 1,200 square meters.

asr-000120
00:25:32.600 --> 00:25:39.580
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: At yung bidding ng warehouse, nakapost na this month, sinisimula na po.

asr-000121
00:25:39.780 --> 00:25:42.780
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: Ngayon, yung 1,200 square meters na yun.

asr-000122
00:25:43.280 --> 00:25:47.580
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: Ang kanyang kasama ay 12 tonners na dryer.

asr-000123
00:25:48.200 --> 00:25:53.880
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: Then, pagka po natapos yung warehouse, next year, lalagyan po natin ang rice processing system 2,

asr-000124
00:25:54.240 --> 00:25:59.720
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: na ang capacity niya ay 3 tons per hour ang input capacity po niya.

asr-000125
00:26:01.260 --> 00:26:01.720
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: Thank you, po.

asr-000126
00:26:03.600 --> 00:26:08.000
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: To add lang, Mr. Chair, kailan yung timeline natin matatapos?

asr-000127
00:26:09.760 --> 00:26:13.000
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: Doon po sa mga contractor natin, binibigyan po natin sila ng...

asr-000128
00:26:13.280 --> 00:26:16.060
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: ng 150 days para po matapos yung warehouse.

asr-000129
00:26:18.640 --> 00:26:22.920
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, Mr. Chair, I think the commitment is by June next year, dapat tapos siya.

asr-000130
00:26:24.300 --> 00:26:24.980
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: Yes, sir.

asr-000131
00:26:25.660 --> 00:26:29.440
PhilMech Director IV Dionisio G. Alvindia, Ph.D.: Pati po yung rice processing system, nandun na rin po, Mr. Com.

asr-000132
00:26:30.860 --> 00:26:34.660
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary, I would like to be clarified lang, ano.

asr-000133
00:26:35.660 --> 00:26:41.660
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Itong mga equipment that goes with the rice processing system,

asr-000134
00:26:43.280 --> 00:26:48.640
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: kapasity of 3 tons per day, is that correct, Mr. Secretary?

asr-000135
00:26:49.140 --> 00:26:51.220
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Mr. Chair, 3 tons per hour po.

asr-000136
00:26:51.220 --> 00:26:53.020
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: Sorry, 3 tons per hour, yes, I'm corrected.

asr-000137
00:26:53.840 --> 00:27:02.920
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: So, tama ba, Mr. Secretary, Mr. Chair, that the equipment that are included in the facility

asr-000138
00:27:02.920 --> 00:27:11.120
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: would be the following, 4-wheel drive tractor, 4 units, laser leveler, 1 unit,

asr-000139
00:27:12.160 --> 00:27:13.200
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: combined harvester.

asr-000140
00:27:13.280 --> 00:27:21.900
Deputy Speaker Ferjenel G. Biron, M.D.: 4 units, flatbed dryer, 4 units, forklift, 2 units, hauling truck, 2 units,

