asr-000222
00:35:16.990 --> 00:35:27.270
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: dahil whatever we experience now or what we learn from now, ngayon lang natin, hihingin lang natin yung budget ngayon para for implementation next year.

asr-000223
00:35:27.270 --> 00:35:34.390
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Para nga ma-address yun. But of course, meron na tayong naging El Nino, three years ago ba?

asr-000224
