asr-000225
00:35:40.850 --> 00:35:46.610
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So things should get better but to catch up is really hard.

asr-000226
00:35:47.330 --> 00:35:52.830
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Some of the interventions na ginagawa nga natin is yung cold storages na tinatayo natin.

asr-000227
00:35:52.830 --> 00:35:59.430
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: May mga mega cold storage, mga modular cold storage na tayong nakabit.

asr-000228
00:36:00.110 --> 00:36:03.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: May mga solar irrigation ng NIA na ginawa.

asr-000229
00:36:03.890 --> 00:36:07.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At meron din ng DA ngayon na ini-implement na solar irrigation.

asr-000230
00:36:07.890 --> 00:36:13.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: We are implementing solar pumps also instead of engine-driven pumps sa ating mga farms.

asr-000231
00:36:13.890 --> 00:36:21.890
