DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: para ma-address natin yung fish kill due to low water or stagnant water among others.

asr-000233
00:36:28.890 --> 00:36:32.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Marami pa po tayong ginagawa, no? Like a small water impounding.

asr-000234
00:36:33.890 --> 00:36:43.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At of course, technology ng seeds na mas malakas sa dry conditions.

asr-000235
00:36:43.890 --> 00:36:48.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At of course, meron din tayong mga tinatawag na protective cultivation systems,

asr-000236
00:36:49.590 --> 00:36:56.270
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: basically mga greenhouses para ngayon magkaroon tayo ng shield sa mga heavy rains and floods

asr-000237
00:36:56.270 --> 00:36:58.210
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: para tuloy-tuloy ang produksyon.

asr-000238
00:36:58.890 --> 00:37:03.730
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So tuloy-tuloy naman ang implementation natin ng mga ito to try to cope up with the,

asr-000239
00:37:03.890 --> 00:37:06.890
