asr-000245
00:37:31.890 --> 00:37:34.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, meron tayong Philippine Crop Insurance, no?

asr-000246
00:37:34.890 --> 00:37:40.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But of course, kailangan mag-apply ang farmer every cropping season para makover sila nito.

asr-000247
00:37:40.890 --> 00:37:44.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Normally, within 21 days after tamaan ng farm,

asr-000248
00:37:44.890 --> 00:37:50.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: nakakapag-issue na tayo ng indemnity check sa ating mga farmers that are affected, no?

asr-000249
00:37:50.890 --> 00:37:56.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But of course, not all. Meron talagang mga ilan na nade-delay kasi nga verification and all of that.

asr-000250
00:37:56.890 --> 00:38:00.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Meron din tayong mga support system.

asr-000251
00:38:00.890 --> 00:38:03.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Support ng seeds and fertilizers to replant.

asr-000252
00:38:03.890 --> 00:38:11.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Normally, nasa regional centers na yan, para for deployment, katulad ngayon sa mga baha na inabot natin dito sa Region 3,

asr-000253
00:38:11.890 --> 00:38:20.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: meron na tayong nakaprepare na seeds and fertilizers para makareplant ka agad, among others.

asr-000254
00:38:20.890 --> 00:38:29.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Meron din tayong loan program sa SURE na up to, I think, 35,000 pwedeng low-interest loan na makakuha ang farmer

asr-000255
00:38:29.890 --> 00:38:31.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: para makarecover.

asr-000256
00:38:31.890 --> 00:38:35.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Meron din tayong programa ng loan restructuring sa kanila.

asr-000257
00:38:35.890 --> 00:38:43.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At worst case scenario, nagbibigay din tayo ng presidential assistance to farmers and fisher folks,

asr-000258
00:38:43.890 --> 00:38:46.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: but unfortunately for this year, medyo naubos na.

asr-000259
00:38:46.890 --> 00:38:50.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Pero humihingi tayong nagdagdag pa from the national government.

asr-000260
00:38:50.890 --> 00:38:57.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Then, meron din tayong tupad na inallocate sa DA para sa mga affected farmers.

asr-000261
00:38:57.890 --> 00:39:04.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Dito sa mga climate changes kung kinakailangan, Mr. Chair.

asr-000262
00:39:04.890 --> 00:39:06.890
Rep. Carl Nicolas C. Cari: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000263
