Rep. Carl Nicolas C. Cari: May libre of subsidized bang soil testing at technical assistance?

asr-000266
00:39:21.890 --> 00:39:25.890
Rep. Carl Nicolas C. Cari: At gaano ito maka-accessible sa mga magsasaka po natin?

asr-000267
