00:39:47.890 --> 00:39:49.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Malaki na rin compared to...

asr-000272
00:39:49.890 --> 00:39:53.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Dating lima lang yan eh. Ngayon nasa mga 20 plus na eh.

asr-000273
00:39:53.890 --> 00:39:56.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, malaking rami yung dinadagdag natin.

asr-000274
00:39:56.890 --> 00:39:58.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But still kulang pa rin.

asr-000275
00:39:58.890 --> 00:40:01.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But libre ito as of the moment.

asr-000276
00:40:01.890 --> 00:40:05.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At pwedeng magpa-test ang mga farmers natin.

asr-000277
00:40:05.890 --> 00:40:13.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But normally naman pag after a bagyo, ang lupa naman normally pwedeng taniman kaagad eh.

asr-000278
00:40:13.890 --> 00:40:15.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Basta lang nag-receive na yung baha.

asr-000279
00:40:15.890 --> 00:40:24.890
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, but soil testing is always good to be more accurate sa pangangailangan ng lupa para maka-save din ang cost, Mr. Chair.

asr-000280
00:40:24.890 --> 00:40:25.890
Rep. Carl Nicolas C. Cari: Thank you po, Mr. Chair.

