asr-000774
01:31:41.090 --> 01:31:44.070
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: dito sa darating na anihan.

asr-000775
01:31:44.910 --> 01:31:46.970
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, pagdating sa funding requirement,

asr-000776
01:31:47.850 --> 01:31:49.010
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang sabi dito sa EO,

asr-000777
01:31:49.270 --> 01:31:52.330
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kukunin po ito sa pondo ng DA,

asr-000778
01:31:52.550 --> 01:31:54.970
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dun sa kanilang mga existing na appropriations

asr-000779
01:31:55.670 --> 01:31:58.310
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng DA at ng iba pang constraint agencies.

asr-000780
01:31:58.850 --> 01:31:59.910
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magkano po ba ang nag-iimbakan?

asr-000781
01:31:59.910 --> 01:32:00.710
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magkano ba na-gastos ninyo

asr-000782
01:32:00.710 --> 01:32:02.930
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mula nang mailabas itong EO na ito

asr-000783
01:32:02.930 --> 01:32:06.230
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: from October 2025 hanggang ngayon?

asr-000784
01:32:06.610 --> 01:32:08.670
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sinabi rin dito, Mr. Chair,

asr-000785
01:32:08.790 --> 01:32:11.410
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na kung kailangan na magkaroon ng pondo

asr-000786
01:32:11.410 --> 01:32:12.810
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa susunod na taon

asr-000787
01:32:12.810 --> 01:32:14.910
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay responsibilidad ng concerned agencies

asr-000788
01:32:15.530 --> 01:32:16.910
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na mag-propose

asr-000789
01:32:17.470 --> 01:32:18.970
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung ano ho yung kailangan nila.

asr-000790
01:32:19.370 --> 01:32:20.830
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, magkano ho ang nag-gastos

asr-000791
01:32:20.830 --> 01:32:23.530
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mula 2025 at meron bang proposal

asr-000792
01:32:23.530 --> 01:32:25.310
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa susunod na taon?

asr-000793
01:32:28.220 --> 01:32:31.320
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: Mr. Chair, pagdating sa EO na yan,

asr-000794
01:32:31.920 --> 01:32:38.460
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: ang pondo lamang po ni NFA na nakukuha sa national government is 9 billion.

asr-000795
01:32:39.200 --> 01:32:43.100
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: So yan po yung ginagasos natin since January.

asr-000796
01:32:43.780 --> 01:32:47.420
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: So kung ano man po yung pondo na nagamit doon,

asr-000797
01:32:47.480 --> 01:32:51.180
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: yun lamang po ang pwedeng ma-attribute dyan po sa EO na yan.

asr-000798
01:32:51.300 --> 01:32:53.980
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: Pero pagdating po sa DA, funding ng DA na kung saan,

asr-000799
01:32:54.720 --> 01:32:57.220
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: sabi nyo nga po, kukuhaan din doon yung ibang mga pondo.

asr-000800
01:32:58.220 --> 01:32:59.540
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: Hindi po tayo aware doon.

asr-000801
01:32:59.600 --> 01:33:01.600
NFA Administrator Larry R. Lacson: Ang aware po tayo doon sa NFA funding.

asr-000802
01:33:02.680 --> 01:33:07.800
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yung sa Mr. Chair, yung sa DA fund naman may dagdag pan 10 billion na hindi pa nagagamit.

asr-000803
01:33:08.600 --> 01:33:11.680
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At gagamitin natin ngayong harvest season na ito,

asr-000804
01:33:11.800 --> 01:33:17.440
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: yung remaining funds ng NFA plus yung 10 billion for the Rice for All program, Madam Chair.

asr-000805
01:33:18.280 --> 01:33:24.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: What about Mr. Chair, yung sinabi ko ng NFA na magre-renta tayo ng mga private warehouses.

asr-000806
01:33:24.360 --> 01:33:26.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magkano po ang kinakailangan para dyan?

asr-000807
01:33:27.480 --> 01:33:31.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At hindi po ba tayo magkakaroon ng mas pinalakas na kampanya

asr-000808
01:33:31.720 --> 01:33:37.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: doon sa mga nabanggit ko kanina from other NGAs, LGUs, GOCCs,

asr-000809
01:33:37.940 --> 01:33:42.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: even state universities and colleges na maaari po natin paggamitan ng public facilities

asr-000810
01:33:42.960 --> 01:33:47.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para mabawasan naman ho yung gastos natin para sa private warehouses?

asr-000811
01:33:48.100 --> 01:33:52.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Just, Mr. Chair, basically ganito, no?

asr-000812
01:33:52.900 --> 01:34:01.360
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yung dating capacity ng NFA when I became Secretary was only 450,000 tons of palay.

asr-000813
01:34:01.720 --> 01:34:10.340
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sa ngayon, marami na tayo natapos na warehouse sa funding nung 2024 GA and 2025 GA

asr-000814
01:34:10.340 --> 01:34:16.720
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: na ang ngayon ang capacity natin is from 500,000 tons, naging 800,000 tons natin.

asr-000815
01:34:17.660 --> 01:34:17.900
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Tama?

asr-000816
01:34:18.640 --> 01:34:24.100
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So 800,000 tons na yung internal capacity ng NFA lang yun.

asr-000817
01:34:24.660 --> 01:34:28.660
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Plus nag-renta pa tayo ng mga warehouses plus yung warehouses sa iba.

asr-000818
01:34:28.660 --> 01:34:31.480
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: With the amount of money we have now,

asr-000819
01:34:31.720 --> 01:34:40.680
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: enough na yung space na capacity natin, base sa buying quantity.

asr-000820
01:34:40.900 --> 01:34:42.560
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Tapos meron pa tayong programa ngayon.

asr-000821
01:34:42.680 --> 01:34:50.000
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Dati kasi ang problema, hindi tayo makapaglabas ng bigas or palay dahil kung walang kalamidad.

asr-000822
01:34:50.600 --> 01:34:56.760
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ngayon meron tayong 20 bigas ng ating 20 peso rice natin.

asr-000823
01:34:56.760 --> 01:34:59.780
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At tuloy-tuloy na ang benta nun, araw-araw.

asr-000824
01:35:00.360 --> 01:35:00.760
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And we're talking about...

asr-000825
01:35:01.720 --> 01:35:09.540
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: 20,000 to eventually 40,000 tons a month yun na tuloy-tuloy lumalabas habang bumili-bili tayo.

asr-000826
01:35:09.660 --> 01:35:14.200
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So we are in a better, much, much better position now than before, Mr. Chair.

asr-000827
01:35:15.480 --> 01:35:21.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, tungkol naman sa implementation ng Executive Order No. 101,

asr-000828
01:35:21.680 --> 01:35:29.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nakadikit itong EO-100 na nag-tutulakho ng full implementation ng Sagipsaka Act.

asr-000829
01:35:29.960 --> 01:35:31.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So magkaugnay po yung dalawang yan.

asr-000830
01:35:31.720 --> 01:35:39.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nais natin ma-require talagang government entities kasama ng LGUs na bumili ng food supplies,

asr-000831
01:35:39.780 --> 01:35:46.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: agricultural products na diretsyo mula sa mga farmers and fisher folk cooperatives.

asr-000832
01:35:46.880 --> 01:35:52.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At dinedirekta din ito sa ilalim ng batas na ito na magkaroon tayo ng mga Sagipsaka desk.

asr-000833
01:35:52.700 --> 01:35:56.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magkano ho ba ang gagastusin dito ng DA para sa susunod na taon?

asr-000834
01:35:56.560 --> 01:35:58.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung maaari din kayong mag-ulat.

asr-000835
01:35:59.000 --> 01:36:00.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kumusta ho ba yung sitwasyon?

asr-000836
01:36:01.720 --> 01:36:04.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagdating sa pagtitiyak, halimbawa dito sa Kongreso,

asr-000837
01:36:05.380 --> 01:36:09.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ang unang pinagkukunan natin ay yung ating mga lokal na mga producers.

asr-000838
01:36:09.820 --> 01:36:13.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagdating sa mga pangangailangan, halimbawa sa pagkain at iba pang mga supplies.

asr-000839
01:36:15.040 --> 01:36:20.460
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sa first part, Mr. Chair, I would like to categorically state na

asr-000840
01:36:20.460 --> 01:36:27.980
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ang ganda ho ng Sagipsaka program na yan at talagang makakatulong sa ating mga farmers and fisher folks.

asr-000841
01:36:29.600 --> 01:36:31.560
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But of course, marami kami matatulong.

asr-000842
01:36:31.720 --> 01:36:37.560
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: May tinitwik ngayon dahil mayroon din mga ibang umaabuso nito at nandadaya in a sense.

asr-000843
01:36:37.720 --> 01:36:41.460
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But in general, talagang magandang advantage ito.

asr-000844
01:36:41.560 --> 01:36:48.440
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yung detalya ng magkano magagastus, I would request na payagan natin si Asik Joycel Panlilio to give the details.

asr-000845
01:36:48.840 --> 01:36:49.620
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Asik Joycel?

asr-000846
01:36:51.280 --> 01:36:52.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-000847
01:36:52.540 --> 01:37:00.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bago natin pakinggan, amingin ko na rin po yung detalye dun sa sinabi ni Secretary na may nang-aabuso, may nandadaya.

asr-000848
01:37:00.460 --> 01:37:01.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May naimbestigahan ba tayo?

asr-000849
01:37:01.720 --> 01:37:04.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May nahabol, may napanagot pagdating dito?

asr-000850
01:37:05.200 --> 01:37:17.520
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sa ngayon, mayroon tayong iniimbestigahan na mga rice supplier sa mga LGU na instead of selling yung local rice,

asr-000851
01:37:17.840 --> 01:37:20.040
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: mukhang imported ang nabenta nila.

asr-000852
01:37:20.300 --> 01:37:24.780
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Pero wala pa kaming, maraming hearsay kasi sa ganun.

asr-000853
01:37:24.780 --> 01:37:28.600
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So we're trying to validate everything.

asr-000854
01:37:28.920 --> 01:37:31.600
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But mayroon kami mga horror stories.

asr-000855
01:37:31.720 --> 01:37:33.360
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mayroon kami mga naririnig sa ganun.

asr-000856
01:37:33.520 --> 01:37:39.980
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Pero mukhang nung umpisa kami mag-investigate, mukhang nag-died na may natakot din.

asr-000857
01:37:40.140 --> 01:37:45.640
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kasi nga siguro may natakot din sa amin, in a sense.

asr-000858
01:37:46.700 --> 01:37:54.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, higin po natin para sa submission sa Committee on Appropriations ng ulat tungkol dito sa mga tinatawag na mga horror stories.

asr-000859
01:37:54.280 --> 01:37:57.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi baka marami dito, hindi lang kwento, pero nangyayari talaga yung abuso.

asr-000860
01:37:58.400 --> 01:38:00.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At dapat may pananagutan pagdating dyan.

asr-000861
01:38:00.540 --> 01:38:01.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Mr. Chair.

asr-000862
01:38:01.520 --> 01:38:07.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sir, pwede na po natin pakinggan yung detalye po ng ulat tungkol sa full implementation ng Sagipsaka Act.

asr-000863
01:38:08.400 --> 01:38:10.520
DA Assistant Secretary Joycel R. Panlilio: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000864
01:38:11.080 --> 01:38:16.320
DA Assistant Secretary Joycel R. Panlilio: Regarding po sa establishment of the Sagipsaka Desk, we have a budget for the establishment this year.

asr-000865
01:38:16.420 --> 01:38:24.600
DA Assistant Secretary Joycel R. Panlilio: But for next year, we only have a budget of around 2 million pesos for ICT equipment for the Sagipsaka Desk.

asr-000866
01:38:24.600 --> 01:38:31.160
DA Assistant Secretary Joycel R. Panlilio: That's exactly 1.95 million po in the entire country, iba-ibang regions po ito.

asr-000867
01:38:31.520 --> 01:38:34.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ito pong 95 million pesos ay fully funded.

asr-000868
01:38:35.060 --> 01:38:37.720
DA Assistant Secretary Joycel R. Panlilio: 1.95 po. This is under the NEP.

asr-000869
01:38:37.720 --> 01:38:37.940
DA Assistant Secretary Joycel R. Panlilio: 1.95 million.

asr-000870
01:38:38.220 --> 01:38:45.600
DA Assistant Secretary Joycel R. Panlilio: Under the NEP. For this year naman po, funded po siya doon po sa budget po ng Sagipsaka for this year.

asr-000871
01:38:46.920 --> 01:38:49.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito ay fully funded for this year and next year?

asr-000872
01:38:49.760 --> 01:38:51.160
DA Assistant Secretary Joycel R. Panlilio: Yes, Madam. Mr. Chair.

asr-000873
01:38:51.700 --> 01:38:58.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At yan din ang hangad natin, Mr. Chair, dun sa marami pang mga programa na kulang-nakulang ang pondo o nakaltasan ng malaking pondo

asr-000874
01:38:58.940 --> 01:39:01.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para po sa susunod na taon.

asr-000875
01:39:01.520 --> 01:39:06.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman po, nais ko rin magtanong tungkol sa farm-to-market roads.

asr-000876
01:39:06.920 --> 01:39:13.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabanggit po kanina yung mga issues, mga anomalies na gusto natin maimbestigahan.

asr-000877
01:39:13.560 --> 01:39:21.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero ang concern naman po ng mga kababaihan, kung meron ba talagang pinupuntahan na merkado yung mga kalsadang ito.

asr-000878
01:39:21.400 --> 01:39:28.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil nakikita po namin na kunti-kunti na po namamatay ang mga public market sa buong bansa.

asr-000879
01:39:28.420 --> 01:39:30.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napapalitan ng mga malalaking retailers.

asr-000880
01:39:30.680 --> 01:39:33.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi naman po masama, pero nais din natin na masuportahan.

asr-000881
01:39:34.680 --> 01:39:40.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Habang may mga malalaking retailers, masuportahan din yung revitalization at redevelopment,

asr-000882
01:39:41.480 --> 01:39:48.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: muling pagsasabuhay ng ating mga pampublikong merkado na pinakaunang pinagbabaksakan ng mga lokal na produkto

asr-000883
01:39:48.900 --> 01:39:51.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating mga magsasaka at mga mangingisda.

asr-000884
01:39:51.740 --> 01:39:58.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron ho bang ganun na requirement, qualification, pagdating sa identification ng farm-to-market roads

asr-000885
01:39:58.220 --> 01:40:00.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na natitiyak na yung mga kalsadang ginagawa.

asr-000886
01:40:00.680 --> 01:40:12.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ay napupunta talaga at dumudulo sa mga merkado, mga pamilihan na magtitiyak din ang abot-kaya at abot-kamay na produkto para sa ating mga kababayan?

asr-000887
01:40:14.160 --> 01:40:20.120
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, basically, all roads eventually lead to a market.

asr-000888
01:40:20.320 --> 01:40:30.120
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But the problem is, sa napaliwanag niya kanina at na 55,000 kilometers pa ang kakulangan sa ating farm-to-market road network sa buong Pilipinas.

asr-000889
01:40:30.680 --> 01:40:38.840
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, yung implement, while the master plan shows that it really goes to the market,

asr-000890
01:40:39.580 --> 01:40:46.880
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: but yung pondong binibigay na 16 billion will only suffice for 1,000 kilometers a year.

asr-000891
01:40:47.420 --> 01:40:50.680
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So talagang, patsi-patsi talagang nakikita.

asr-000892
01:40:51.560 --> 01:40:58.020
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Although some areas, talagang may malapit na yung makompleto, talagang may mahahaba na.

asr-000893
01:40:58.020 --> 01:41:00.540
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But yung may tinatawag tayong road.

asr-000894
01:41:00.680 --> 01:41:06.160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Influence area, may poverty incidents na kinukonsider, number of farmers or fisherfolk beneficiaries,

asr-000895
01:41:06.640 --> 01:41:14.700
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: distance to network links, present road conditions, climate change adaptation, average daily traffic, tinitignan din natin yun.

asr-000896
01:41:14.840 --> 01:41:21.360
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Plus, of course, there are farm-to-market na missionary routes talaga na kailangan mong buksan ng bagong production area

asr-000897
01:41:21.360 --> 01:41:29.360
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: o kaya may isolated barangay na talagang kailangan nalagyan ng kalye para yung produkto nila maibaba kahit hindi ganong karami yun.

asr-000898
01:41:29.860 --> 01:41:30.460
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But at least it will help.

asr-000899
01:41:30.680 --> 01:41:32.340
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: It will help that particular community.

asr-000900
01:41:32.560 --> 01:41:35.540
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So kasi ang farm-to-market is not only for agri.

asr-000901
01:41:35.680 --> 01:41:39.980
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Pag tinayo natin yan, ang raming other benefits to the local economy.

asr-000902
01:41:40.240 --> 01:41:41.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Alam naman natin.

asr-000903
01:41:41.180 --> 01:41:41.920
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000904
01:41:42.600 --> 01:41:46.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, panghuli na lang na manifestation dahil naubos na rin ang aking oras.

asr-000905
01:41:47.100 --> 01:41:50.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakita namin sa consultation sa mga public market vendors.

asr-000906
01:41:51.500 --> 01:41:54.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nandyan ang Department of Agriculture para sa price monitoring,

asr-000907
01:41:54.800 --> 01:41:58.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng agricultural products.

asr-000908
01:41:58.560 --> 01:42:00.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit ang isang sa nakita namin,

asr-000909
01:42:00.680 --> 01:42:05.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang malaking gap na wala pong nagtitiyak na sa pangkabuan

asr-000910
01:42:05.260 --> 01:42:09.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay na-maintain na natin yung mga public markets.

asr-000911
01:42:09.460 --> 01:42:12.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lubos po yan na kaasa sa local government units

asr-000912
01:42:12.060 --> 01:42:15.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa administration, management,

asr-000913
01:42:15.640 --> 01:42:18.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lahat ng issues na may kinalama sa sanitation, hygiene,

asr-000914
01:42:19.320 --> 01:42:23.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: maintenance ng mga micro and small businesses dun sa area.

asr-000915
01:42:24.220 --> 01:42:28.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa tingin ko, hindi dapat buong-buong bitawan ito ng pambansang pamahalaan

asr-000916
01:42:28.500 --> 01:42:30.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil bukod sa trabaho,

asr-000917
01:42:30.480 --> 01:42:31.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at kabuhayan,

asr-000918
01:42:31.640 --> 01:42:35.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: napakalaki nang nagagawa nito para sa lokal na agrikultura.

asr-000919
01:42:35.140 --> 01:42:42.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na matiyak na may madaling malapitan at mapuntahan yung ating mga kababayan

asr-000920
01:42:42.020 --> 01:42:44.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa mga pampublikong merkado.

asr-000921
01:42:44.720 --> 01:42:51.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagkailangan nila ng halimbawa ng pambili ng pagkain ng gulay, ng prutas.

asr-000922
01:42:51.420 --> 01:42:55.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa public markets, makakatawad ka pa eh.

asr-000923
01:42:55.140 --> 01:42:57.900
