asr-001384
02:00:49.420 --> 02:00:50.780
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes po, Mr. Chair.

asr-001385
02:00:50.780 --> 02:00:54.840
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: We were asked to answer the questions per number.

asr-001386
02:00:55.540 --> 02:01:00.480
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So for number one, yun yung binigay ni Secretary po, yung background.

asr-001387
02:01:01.340 --> 02:01:09.100
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Actually, chemical pesticide naman po if they're talking about the price in container,

asr-001388
02:01:09.640 --> 02:01:13.920
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: the containers po are usually one liter or one gallon or four liters.

asr-001389
02:01:14.640 --> 02:01:19.920
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: And the average cost per liter is about 2,000 pesos.

asr-001390
02:01:19.920 --> 02:01:26.860
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So when used in one hectare, it actually goes down to 1,000 pesos per hectare per application,

asr-001391
02:01:27.360 --> 02:01:29.840
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: not the 10,000 po mentioned.

asr-001392
02:01:31.340 --> 02:01:41.380
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So initially, why is the DA and SRA using chemical pesticides instead of other means?

asr-001393
02:01:41.380 --> 02:01:52.100
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: As the Secretary said, the intensity of the RSSI infestation requires us to use chemical pesticides

asr-001394
02:01:52.100 --> 02:02:01.040
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: as a first resort as producing the biocontrols takes time.

asr-001395
02:02:01.340 --> 02:02:08.020
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So for number one, actually, we have already provided a total of 209 million,

asr-001396
02:02:08.560 --> 02:02:18.040
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: of which 23 million went to chemical pesticides and the rest went to fertilizers for the recovering fields.

asr-001397
02:02:19.520 --> 02:02:26.560
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: There's an additional budget from the DA of 10 million for chemical pesticides as well.

asr-001398
02:02:27.060 --> 02:02:31.040
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So for the area of coverage, we already had...

asr-001399
02:02:31.340 --> 02:02:37.500
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: distributed chemicals good for about 35,000 hectares.

asr-001400
02:02:37.500 --> 02:02:51.600
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: How much more is needed in terms of to cover all of the area is probably around 120 million pesos more

asr-001401
02:02:51.600 --> 02:02:59.680
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: for the initial application because it does not take only one application to control it.

asr-001402
02:02:59.720 --> 02:03:01.540
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So you need probably two sprayings.

asr-001403
02:03:01.880 --> 02:03:02.900
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So that's for number one.

asr-001404
02:03:03.740 --> 02:03:05.800
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: For question number two po.

asr-001405
