SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes.

asr-001408
02:03:17.080 --> 02:03:18.120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: By hectares, how many?

asr-001409
02:03:18.120 --> 02:03:18.860
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes po.

asr-001410
02:03:19.980 --> 02:03:24.820
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yung reported area po, Mr. Chair, is 134,000 hectares.

asr-001411
02:03:25.220 --> 02:03:30.160
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yung verified area po is 67,443 hectares.

asr-001412
02:03:32.180 --> 02:03:32.480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Okay.

asr-001413
02:03:37.140 --> 02:03:38.840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Can you please answer number two?

asr-001414
02:03:38.960 --> 02:03:43.630
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Okay.

asr-001415
02:03:43.810 --> 02:03:50.440
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: For number two, has the DA looked at the lower cost?

asr-001416
02:03:50.680 --> 02:03:51.100
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yun po, ma'am.

asr-001417
02:03:51.760 --> 02:03:52.480
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes.

asr-001418
02:03:52.740 --> 02:04:03.000
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Since 2025, the SRA and the DA have been producing a fungi which effectively kills RSSI.

asr-001419
02:04:03.800 --> 02:04:14.480
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: This costs about around 150 pesos per hectare which amounts to about 1,500 pesos per hectare.

asr-001420
02:04:14.480 --> 02:04:14.660
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Okay.

asr-001421
02:04:15.320 --> 02:04:16.060
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: If applied.

asr-001422
02:04:16.840 --> 02:04:22.280
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: The only hindrance to this is production of the fungi is very, very slow.

asr-001423
02:04:23.240 --> 02:04:27.040
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: The laboratory facilities of the SRA are limited.

asr-001424
02:04:28.100 --> 02:04:36.360
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: And as a result, the secretary has already instructed all available DA and government laboratories

asr-001425
02:04:36.360 --> 02:04:42.340
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: as well as state universities to assist in producing the said fungi.

asr-001426
02:04:43.300 --> 02:04:45.080
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: We've been doing it successfully.

asr-001427
02:04:45.080 --> 02:04:46.000
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: We've been doing it successfully in Region 10.

asr-001428
02:04:46.960 --> 02:04:53.940
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: And also, we've went down to meet with the LGUs, especially in Negros.

asr-001429
02:04:54.500 --> 02:05:04.200
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: And they will come up with proposals for LGU-based laboratories to further produce our biocontrol agents.

asr-001430
02:05:04.960 --> 02:05:12.000
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: This will assist in production as these agents will be needed in the future.

asr-001431
02:05:12.000 --> 02:05:15.000
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: And it's a continuing process.

asr-001432
02:05:15.080 --> 02:05:19.400
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So, we need the established laboratories to take place.

asr-001433
02:05:20.000 --> 02:05:25.440
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: And I think the DA also has earmarked a budget for the laboratories.

asr-001434
02:05:25.660 --> 02:05:29.880
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: I think an additional 300 million if I remember right, Secretary.

asr-001435
02:05:30.160 --> 02:05:30.220
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes.

asr-001436
02:05:30.700 --> 02:05:33.340
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So, that's moving forward in the future.

asr-001437
02:05:33.880 --> 02:05:36.980
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: But the initial step actually taken was chemicals.

asr-001438
02:05:37.220 --> 02:05:38.160
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: That's for number two.

asr-001439
02:05:39.420 --> 02:05:44.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, how much does DA need for shifting for chemical-based approaches?

asr-001440
02:05:44.560 --> 02:05:44.860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 300 million?

asr-001441
02:05:44.860 --> 02:05:48.640
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: The Secretary already earmarked 300 million.

asr-001442
02:05:49.080 --> 02:05:53.760
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: That includes establishing laboratories to produce the agents.

asr-001443
02:05:55.280 --> 02:05:56.000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Okay.

asr-001444
02:05:56.220 --> 02:06:08.920
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: For number three, for IBM?

asr-001445
02:06:09.200 --> 02:06:09.320
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes.

asr-001446
02:06:09.760 --> 02:06:19.480
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: For number three, Mr. Chair, as of the moment, since we cannot wait for the 2027 budget,

asr-001447
