SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: the DA already released to...

asr-001448
02:06:22.860 --> 02:06:26.860
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: will release to LGUs directly.

asr-001449
02:06:26.900 --> 02:06:34.060
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: 35 million to be an initial budget to fight RSSI, the chemical way.

asr-001450
02:06:35.120 --> 02:06:41.120
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Further budgets will be released as a quick response fund coming from the DA and SRA as needed.

asr-001451
