Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, how do you distribute 35 million for LGUs?

asr-001452
02:06:46.220 --> 02:06:52.780
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: The distribution was based on their verified affected areas.

asr-001453
02:06:52.780 --> 02:06:53.900
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes, ma'am.

