SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: No, this...

asr-001459
02:07:07.780 --> 02:07:10.980
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: The 35 million is for the Negros Island region only.

asr-001460
02:07:11.660 --> 02:07:11.880
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes.

asr-001461
02:07:12.220 --> 02:07:18.320
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So, for additional budgets will be needed for Luzon and Bukidnon,

asr-001462
02:07:18.440 --> 02:07:21.900
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: but the infestation rate is a lot lower than Negros.

asr-001463
02:07:22.700 --> 02:07:23.120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Okay.

