Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Actually, Sek, thank you so much. That was actually my next question to you.

asr-001572
02:35:34.080 --> 02:35:43.800
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The PAF played such a huge role in responding to the Middle East conflict and the fuel crisis and energy crisis that transpired after.

asr-001573
02:35:44.340 --> 02:35:49.780
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Siguro po, Sek, kasi yung sunod natin, diba, nitong mga nakaraang linggo, buwan, yung habagat.

asr-001574
02:35:49.780 --> 02:35:52.780
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Tapos, meron na rin po, sana naman po hindi...

asr-001575
02:35:53.740 --> 02:35:58.620
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mangyari na ganun ka't hindi, but yung El Niño na nagbabadya po.

asr-001576
